      "responsible for the implementation and training of personnel in surveying ",
      "technologies such as GPS, laser scanning (LiDAR), and Unmanned Aerial ",
      "Systems.  As a Certified Federal Surveyor, Steve has specialized training in the ",
      "U.S. Public Land Survey System, and boundary determination.",
      "Project Experience",
      "Indiana-Michigan State Line.  Survey Project Manager.  Responsible for the ",
      "research, recovery, survey, and perpetuation of 45 milepost monument ",
      "positions along the Indiana-Michigan state line.  Tasks included analyzing ",
      "the original government plats/field notes; searching for remaining evidence ",
      "of bearing trees; searching for memorials; analyzing topographic features; ",
      "re-establishing lost and obliterated monuments; analyzing public land ",
      "survey corners in relation to opinion monuments and improvements; ",
      "creating drawings detailing findings that show the state plane coordinates ",
      "and latitude/longitude of each surveyed point. (2021-2024)",
      "Indiana-Michigan State Line Cost Study.  Survey Project Manager.  ",
